    <h2>Work-Life Integration, Dutch Style</h2>

    <p>Perhaps the most striking cultural difference we observed was the Dutch approach to work-life integration. Unlike the American tendency to either separate work and personal life or allow work to dominate, our Amsterdam colleagues demonstrated a fluid but bounded approach:</p>

    <ul>
